Passages 0 and 2 give different teams (Pat Ferris vs. Jordan Chandler) for the same person's current alternate role, so they cannot both be true. Passage 1 says Lilly played for Ian Dickie, Krell and Willsey, and passage 3 gives his junior record. Neither names a current alternate team, so neither conflicts with passages 0 or 2.

Deciding which of 0 and 2 is false is difficult. From memory, Evan Lilly was alternate on Team Jordan Chandler (Wikipedia: "He is currently the alternate on Team Jordan Chandler."). That is not certain, but it is my best recollection, so passage 0 is more likely the misinformation.

