Passages 1 and 3 give different numbers of available cards (15 vs 16), so they contradict each other. Onitama's base game ships with 16 movement cards, so passage 1 is most likely the misinformation.

Passages 0 and 2 describe expansions and say nothing about the card count, so they do not conflict with anything.

